{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped in a decaying Eastern European concrete block, you\u2019re not a soldier \u2014 you\u2019re just trying to survive. Escape your commie flat while dodging threats from all sides: buzzing drones, thunderous artillery, bursts of gunfire, armored vehicles, and the ever-present shadow of the draft officer who won\u2019t stop until you\u2019re caught.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every corner could be your last \u2014 hiding under the bed or stuffing yourself in the fridge won\u2019t cut it this time. Outsmart, outmaneuver, and outlast as you search for the perfect hiding place in a world where the walls themselves feel hostile.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Threats</strong> \u2014 Patrol drones sweep the streets, their spotlights cutting through the smog while cameras record every twitch. The buildings and corruption remain unchanged from the post-Soviet days, but the war has upgraded: drones now rule the battlefield. They\u2019ll usually ignore you \u2014 not out of mercy for civilians, but because you\u2019re simply worth less than their spare parts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755280/extras/4b988e27cae807ac00e43125e7d3dd54.poster.avif?t=1756508512\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755280/extras/4b988e27cae807ac00e43125e7d3dd54.webm?t=1756508512\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755280/extras/4b988e27cae807ac00e43125e7d3dd54.mp4?t=1756508512\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Incoming Fire</strong> \u2014 Artillery shells and small-arms fire rip through the landscape. In theory, both armies avoid targeting civilians\u2026 but this is Eastern Europe. Stray rockets, random barrages, and the occasional burst of small-arms fire are just part of the ambiance. And don\u2019t forget those ever-persistent draft officers, taking potshots like it\u2019s their national pastime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755280/extras/14a60b70dcc4a5f63c6c0d3b90e83e6b.poster.avif?t=1756508512\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755280/extras/14a60b70dcc4a5f63c6c0d3b90e83e6b.webm?t=1756508512\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755280/extras/14a60b70dcc4a5f63c6c0d3b90e83e6b.mp4?t=1756508512\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steel Monsters</strong> \u2013 Tanks and APCs roll past, rattling the earth as they prowl for anyone dumb enough to cross their path. Basements and sewers may be your best bet \u2014 though down there, the local gopnik population rules supreme. They\u2019re territorial, tracksuits bristling, and dangerously sober\u2026 unless, of course, you can placate them with the sacred offering of a High Voltage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755280/extras/d6807e62f2d59c11dcf793d9069185fc.poster.avif?t=1756508512\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755280/extras/d6807e62f2d59c11dcf793d9069185fc.webm?t=1756508512\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755280/extras/d6807e62f2d59c11dcf793d9069185fc.mp4?t=1756508512\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Draft Officer</strong> \u2014 the most dangerous predator of all. He doesn\u2019t need guns, just a clipboard and a flashlight. Yet he still carries one in case you decide to flee, driven by a relentless determination to avoid the frontlines himself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755280/extras/285fb76e325c3f687c1ea7ddaf9a325f.poster.avif?t=1756508512\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755280/extras/285fb76e325c3f687c1ea7ddaf9a325f.webm?t=1756508512\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755280/extras/285fb76e325c3f687c1ea7ddaf9a325f.mp4?t=1756508512\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Easy Hiding</strong> \u2013 Beds and fridges won\u2019t save you. Find unexpected hiding spots, blend with the environment, and stay one step ahead. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755280/extras/f7d8cc7059ea2bd4d47cdff284622fa3.poster.avif?t=1756508512\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755280/extras/f7d8cc7059ea2bd4d47cdff284622fa3.webm?t=1756508512\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755280/extras/f7d8cc7059ea2bd4d47cdff284622fa3.mp4?t=1756508512\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Survival</strong> \u2013 Stark Soviet-style architecture, the oppressive sounds of conflict outside, and the claustrophobic tension of being hunted \u2014 for Westerners, it\u2019s straight out of a horror movie; for Eastern European <i>kommunalka</i> dwellers, it\u2019s just another Tuesday.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755280/extras/77aa7a40fe70dff91ab9c2746c824d0d.poster.avif?t=1756508512\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755280/extras/77aa7a40fe70dff91ab9c2746c824d0d.webm?t=1756508512\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755280/extras/77aa7a40fe70dff91ab9c2746c824d0d.mp4?t=1756508512\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Why You\u2019ll Play Again</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each attempt is different. Patrol routes, bombardments, and officer searches change every run. Your only chance is to adapt. Will you risk moving or stay hidden in the dark?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Add Stranded in Conflict to your Steam Wishlists</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755280/extras/8df46a41ddf87ac1ffdb7dc142033c38.poster.avif?t=1756508512\" width=780 height=102 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755280/extras/8df46a41ddf87ac1ffdb7dc142033c38.webm?t=1756508512\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755280/extras/8df46a41ddf87ac1ffdb7dc142033c38.mp4?t=1756508512\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"htt