ewers may be your best bet \u2014 though down there, the local gopnik population rules supreme. They\u2019re territorial, tracksuits bristling, and dangerously sober\u2026 unless, of course, you can placate them with the sacred offering of a High Voltage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755280/extras/d6807e62f2d59c11dcf793d9069185fc.poster.avif?t=1756508512\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755280/extras/d6807e62f2d59c11dcf793d9069185fc.webm?t=1756508512\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755280/extras/d6807e62f2d59c11dcf793d9069185fc.mp4?t=1756508512\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Draft Officer</strong> \u2014 the most dangerous predator of all. He doesn\u2019t need guns, just a clipboard and a flashlight. Yet he still carries one in case you decide to flee, driven by a relentless determination to avoid the frontlines himself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755280/extras/285fb76e325c3f687c1ea7ddaf9a325f.poster.avif?t=1756508512\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755280/extras/285fb76e325c3f687c1ea7ddaf9a325f.webm?t=1756508512\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755280/extras/285fb76e325c3f687c1ea7ddaf9a325f.mp4?t=1756508512\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Easy Hiding</strong> \u2013 Beds and fridges won\u2019t save you. Find unexpected hidi